      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The tengu bladesmith Interacts to draw a weapon in the sword group, then attempts to disarm a weapon held by a foe within reach. The weapon the tengu bladesmith draws gains the disarm trait for this attempt."
